          "name": "Where is Vincennes University located?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The main campus of Vincennes University is located at 1002 North First Street, Vincennes, Indiana 47591. The 200-acre residential campus sits in southwest Indiana. VU also maintains a secondary campus in Jasper, Indiana, plus additional centers in Indianapolis, Lebanon, and Gibson County."
