                     		 <img src="/_resources/images/general-website-images/visit-tour-png/sm-yellow-squaty-star.png" alt="Arrow" class="sm-squat-star star-right">
                     		
                     <div class="col-12 row d-flex justify-content-center" style="height: 60%; width: 100%; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;">
                        			
                        <h3 class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center quote-h3" style="width: 80%; height: 100%; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #fff; font-family: 'montserrrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; text-transform: none;">"The best school a student could imagine going to. Great community and always a fun
