                     <div class="quote-column quote-column-left" id="quotesColumn1">
                        
                        <p class="quotes" id="dynamicQuote1">
                           Vincennes University is one of the most historically significant institutions in the
                           United States—Indiana's First College, founded in 1801 by U.S. President William Henry
                           Harrison. <br><br>VU has shaped education in America for over two centuries with a legacy of inclusion,
                           accessibility, and academic excellence.
                           </p>
                        </div>
                     
                     
                     <div class="video-container">
                        
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center" style="width: 100%;">
                           
                           <div class="d-flex justify-content-center" style="width: 50%">
                              
                              <p class="fancy-text">At VU, it's not about who gets left out—<br> <span class="glow">it's about who gets brought in.</span></p>
                              </div>
                           </div>
                        
                        <!-- Dedicated wrapper anchors the toggle button tightly to the video frame -->
                        
                        <div class="statue-video-wrapper">
                           <video id="loopVideo" width="100%" autoplay="true" muted="true" loop="true" playsinline="true" title="Vincennes University Statue Dressing Stop-Motion">
                              
                              <source src="/_resources/videos/web-resources/Vincennes-University-Statue-Long.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                              
                              <track src="https://www.vinu.edu/_resources/videos/web-resources/statue_dressing.vtt" kind="descriptions" srclang="en" label="Visual Description">
                              Your browser does not support the video tag.
                              </video>
                           
                           <!-- WCAG 2.2.2 Pause/Play Control Button -->
                           <button id="loopVideo-toggle" class="statue-video-toggle" aria-controls="loopVideo" type="button" aria-label="Pause background video" aria-pressed="false">
                              
                              <img id="statue-icon-pause" src="/_resources/images/icons/pause-wabash.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="28" height="28">
                              
                              <img id="statue-icon-play" src="/_resources/images/icons/play-wabash.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="28" height="28" style="display:none;">
                              </button>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                     
                     <div class="quote-column quote-column-right" id="quotesColumn2">
                        
                        <p class="quotes" id="dynamicQuote2">
                           With global industry partners, hands-on learning, and career-driven programs, students
                           don't just earn degrees—they break barriers, open doors, blaze trails and redefine
                           success. <br><br>VU delivers more than an education—it's a launchpad for lifelong impact and career
                           success.
                           </p>
                        </div>
                     
                     
